## Recorded by CI, on every push

The example app's three clips, as its last push to `main` recorded them. When
the app changes, these change with it; when a clip no longer matches the app,
the push fails instead.

<Clips base="{{clips}}" version="{{version}}" />

## Install

```bash
{{install}}
```

Then say what the clip should show — `/versioncam "Show a user filtering the list down to one shipment"` — and the skill writes it, records it, has a reviewer look at the result, and fixes what the reviewer finds.

